  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A constant force <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span> is applied to a rod at point <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B\"></span> and as a result, the rod rotates about point <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"A\"></span>. </p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>The length of the rod is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"50\\; \\textup{cm}\"></span> and the angle between <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span> and the rod is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"30^{\\circ}\"></span>. The net torque about point <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"A\"></span> is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"25\\; \\textup{N\\,m}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the magnitude of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span>?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"25\\; \\textup{N}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"50\\; \\textup{N}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"100\\; \\textup{N}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"200\\; \\textup{N}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
